# Artifacts stay out (size, regenerable). Interpretation records do NOT:
# RESULT.md files, banners and manifests are what the paper cites as a record
# of interpretation, so they must be commits, not mutable files. Note the
# `results/*` form is deliberate -- git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so a bare `results/` + `!results/*.md` silently fails.
results/*
!results/*.md
runs/
llm-outputs/
data/*.pt
*.log
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
scripts/audit/out/
# Secrets — API keys never enter git (SS Q frontier arm)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*_secret*
src/orion.egg-info/
